    "here we replace occurance of  alphabets (both upper and lower)in th \"temperature\" column with a empty string .\n",
    "replace any occurence of the alphabets in the 'windspeed' column with an empty srtng \n",
    "replace any occurence of the alphabets in the 'event' column with an empty string \n",
    "the replace()method will remove all alphabetic charecter from the specified column \n",
    "regex=true this parameter indicates that the replacement values are specified using regular expression \n",
    "this means that instead of exact string matches ,pandas will look for patterns that match the specified values \n"
   ]
